          ]
        },
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "sd24",
          "text": ", our lawyers are ready to help injured people get on the path to recovery following a motorcycle accident. We are committed to providing compassionate, personalized service and will go the extra mile to handle your legal claims so you can focus on healing and getting your life back to normal.",
          "marks": []
        }
